# Web service and service reference generated files
# =================================================
# These are often regenerated and can cause frequent conflicts.
# Keep them out of source control unless you have a specific reason to include them.
Connected Services/*/
Service References/*/
*.wsdl
*.xsd
*.svcinfo
*.map
*.disco
